nd a passionate community of members, Highlands Coffee is poised to make a lasting impact in the industry and serve as an inspiring example for brands worldwide. </p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                    In the words of <i>David Thai - Founder &amp; CEO of Highlands Coffee,</i> <i>\"I had a dream, but it's no longer just my dream. I realized that this dream is bigger than me, bigger than all of us. TOGETHER, LET'S BRING THE BEST OF VIETNAM TO THE WORLD.\"</i> This inspiring message completely encapsulates the spirit of Highlands Coffee® and its commitment to creating a vibrant community brand that celebrates Vietnamese heritage, fosters unity, and embraces the passion and creativity of its members. </p>            \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
