f learning and creativity and encourage employee engagement, Mr, Nguyen Quang Thai has initiated 2 training programs.  </p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                    “The Transformer” program is designed for every employee to helped them <b>become a better version</b> of themselves every day. Unlike regular training courses, during the 4 months of training, employees will learn with practice by applying a set of 12 keywords: <b><i>Listening, Promise – Fulfilment, Three Rules, Integrity, Unbox gift, Recognition, Self-awareness is the root, Agreement, Racket, Story – Reality, Good Relationship, Mindfulness</i></b> to bring happiness to themselves, their family and society. Since 2019, the program has offered 12 seasons, with Mr. Nguyen Quang Thai directly trained and provided guidance to each participant.   </p>           \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
