c brand X-Men, while also provide a portfolio of traditional Vietnamese food seasoning products under Thuan Phat brand. Especially, 2022 also marked the footprint for Marico SEA when making its entry into Female Personal Care category through three significant brands Lashe Superfood, Purite De Provence and Ôliv.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
