          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                    Amway Vietnam, a subsidiary of Amway Corporation operating in Vietnam since 2008, has been growing sustainably &amp; becoming one of the most successful and reputable direct selling companies in Vietnam.</p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>\n                    Amway Vietnam Leadership Team</b> is a local diverse and collaborative team, who together lead and drive <b>Amway Vietnam’s transformation</b> to achieve business sustainable growth successes and unleash Amway’s people full potential.</p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">In the three years period of 2019 – 2022, on top of macro challenges that could create headwinds for all business such as Covid and rising inflation Amway Vietnam also has to cope with the increasing strict regulations on business operations and the yet-to-improve reputation of MLM industry. Despite such impediments,  Amway Vietnam Leadership Team has been resiliently turned around and successfully driven business growth:<br>-&nbsp;<b>Nearly Doubled Amway Vietnam's Sales Revenues</b> from 60 milion USD (2019) to 110 million USD (2022).<br>- <b>Business Growth Rate</b>  increasing from 7,4% (2019) to 25% (2022)\n<br>- <b>Market Share in Vietnam </b>MLM industry improved from 15% (2019) to 20% (2022)<br>\n<br>Remarkaly, in 2022 Amway Vietnam has surpassed more than 100 markets globally to be recognized as <b>top 10 markets with the highest business growth rate</b>.<br><br>These outstanding results mark the relentless efforts of Amway Leadership team to transform the organization across aspects, from vision to business strategies as well as culture and talent pipeline.<br></p>            \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
